== Corpus.parse
"# comment\n\na \"GET\\r\\n\"\n  b\t\"x\\000\"  \n" -> a="GET\r\n"; b="x\000"
"a \"unterminated\n" -> error: line 1: scanf: bad input at char number 15: scanning of a String failed: premature end of file occurred before end of token
"a\n" -> error: line 1: no input
"\"no name\"\n" -> error: line 1: scanf: bad input at char number 4: looking for '"', found 'n'
"a \"x\" trailing\n" -> error: line 1: scanf: bad input at char number 5: end of input not found
